cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "FoldNucleus"
abstract: >
  A structure-guided pipeline that ranks residue-level structural emergence
  in single-domain proteins using ESMFold fragment predictions, native-contact
  recovery, backbone agreement, compactness, model confidence and native
  topology. Its fragment-emergence score is evaluated against HDX protection
  and is not a calibrated probability of folding-nucleus membership.
